    {
      "source": "Remove and return all matching documents. <br/>\n<strong>NOTE:</strong> The entire list of documents will be fetched before sending the actual delete commands.\nAlso, <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationEvent.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationEvent</code></a>s will be published for each and every delete\noperation.",
      "translation": "删除并返回所有匹配的文档。<br/>\n<strong>注意：</strong> 在发送实际的删除命令之前，会先获取整个文档列表。此外，对于每一次删除操作，都会发布 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationEvent.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationEvent</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Remove and return all matching documents.",
      "translation": "删除并返回所有匹配的文档。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
